. local dummies Wleft Wm2 Wm1 Wp1 Wp2 Wp3 Wp4 Wp5 Wp6 Wright

. gen byte checksum = Wleft+Wm2+Wm1+Wp1+Wp2+Wp3+Wp4+Wp5+Wp6+Wright

